      "problem_summary_body": "This dataset examines how eight numerical measurements describing concrete mixture composition and curing age relate to concrete compressive strength. The task is continuous regression: the model predicts compressive strength as a numeric value on the original MPa scale. Results describe predictive relationships in the observed data and should not be interpreted as causal effects of individual mixture components.",
